---
/* "Nothing changes until you say yes." One example conversation: the athlete's message, then the
   Coach's plan-change card rebuilt from lib/features/coach/proposals/coach_proposal_card.dart.
   Kind: temporary_block, reason travel (supabase/functions/_shared/coach_proposals/training.ts).
   The markup is the finished, approved state; scripts/extras.js plays the sequence on top. */
---
<section class="sec wrap" id="change" aria-labelledby="change-h">
  <div class="ch">
    <div class="ch-copy">
      <h2 class="sec-h disp" id="change-h">Nothing changes until you say yes.</h2>
      <p class="sec-sub">Tell your Coach what's coming up. It works out the change, shows it next to your current plan, and waits for you.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ch-stage">
      <div class="ch-chat app" data-ch-chat aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="ch-top">
          <span class="ch-top-t"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16"><path d="M4 6.5C4 5.1 5.1 4 6.5 4h11C18.9 4 20 5.1 20 6.5v8c0 1.4-1.1 2.5-2.5 2.5H11l-4.5 3.5V17C5.1 17 4 15.9 4 14.5z"/></svg>Coach</span>
          <span class="ch-tag">Example</span>
        </div>

        <div class="ch-q" data-ch="q"><p>I'm away for two weeks from Monday. Hotel gym, dumbbells only.</p></div>

        <div class="ch-reply">
          <div class="ch-typing" data-ch="typing"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>

          <div class="ch-card" data-ch="card">
            <div class="ch-p ch-chips">
              <span class="ch-chip"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 1.6l5.2 2v3.7c0 3.2-2.1 5.6-5.2 7.1-3.1-1.5-5.2-3.9-5.2-7.1V3.6z"/><path d="M5.6 8l1.7 1.7 3.2-3.4"/></svg>Proposed by Coach &middot; checked by Tracend</span>
              <span class="ch-swap" data-ch="status">
                <span class="ch-chip amber is-a"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M4.5 2h7M4.5 14h7M5 2c0 3 1.5 4 3 6-1.5 2-3 3-3 6M11 2c0 3-1.5 4-3 6 1.5 2 3 3 3 6"/></svg>Waiting for you</span>
                <span class="ch-chip good is-b"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6.2"/><path d="M5.2 8.2l2 2 3.6-3.8"/></svg>Applied</span>
              </span>
            </div>

            <h3 class="ch-p ch-title">Home block until 13 Dec</h3>
            <p class="ch-p ch-ends">Ends 13 Dec. Your regular plan comes back after.</p>

            <div class="ch-p ch-ba">
              <div class="ch-ba-r ch-ba-h"><span></span><span>Now</span><span>After</span></div>
              <div class="ch-ba-r"><span>Plan</span><span>Upper lower</span><b>Home block until 13 Dec</b></div>
              <div class="ch-ba-r"><span>Sessions</span><span>4 sessions a week</span><b>3 sessions a week</b></div>
              <div class="ch-ba-r"><span>Equipment</span><span>Your usual setup</span><b>dumbbells</b></div>
            </div>


            <p class="ch-p ch-swap ch-line" data-ch="line">
              <span class="is-a">Open until Mon 30 Nov</span>
              <span class="is-b">You can undo this until Fri 4 Dec</span>
            </p>

            <div class="ch-p ch-acts ch-swap" data-ch="acts">
              <div class="ch-act is-a">
                <span class="ch-btn ch-approve" data-ch="approve">
                  <span class="ch-lab is-a">Approve</span>
                  <span class="ch-lab is-b"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3.2 8.4l3 3 6.6-6.8"/></svg>Approved</span>
                  <i class="ch-ripple" data-ch="ripple"></i>
                </span>
                <div class="ch-two"><span class="ch-btn ghost">Not now</span><span class="ch-btn ghost">Change it</span></div>
              </div>
              <div class="ch-act is-b">
                <span class="ch-btn ghost ch-undo">Undo</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="sr-only">Example conversation. The athlete writes: I'm away for two weeks from Monday. Hotel gym, dumbbells only. Coach replies with a plan change card, proposed by Coach and checked by Tracend, titled Home block until 13 Dec. Now: 4 sessions a week with your usual setup. After: 3 sessions a week with dumbbells until 13 Dec, then your regular plan comes back. The card states the downside, that strength may stall for the block. It offers Approve, Not now and Change it. After Approve the card reads Applied and offers Undo, which works for 7 days.</p>
    </div>

    <p class="ch-note">Each approved change is saved as a new version. Undo it within 7 days.</p>
  </div>
</section>
